    {
      "id": 136, "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [-2530, 4830], "size": [440, 500],
      "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [], "outputs": [],
      "title": "Note: Model Links",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": ["## Model Links\n\n**vae**\n\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n`📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 text_encoders/\n│       └── qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors`\n\n## Required custom nodes\n\n- Nougan Edit Prompt Template, Nougan Before / After (Nougan pack)\n- PathchSageAttentionKJ (comfyui-kjnodes)\n\nNote: update ComfyUI first — MiniMax H3 needs a recent build."],
      "color": "#432", "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 138, "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [-2060, 4830], "size": [440, 520],
      "flags": {}, "order": 1, "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [], "outputs": [],
      "title": "Note: Nougan Outpaint v1",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": ["## Nougan Outpaint v1\n\nH3 has no native outpaint mode, so this workflow runs the **pad → condition → generate** trick:\n\n1. **Scale down** the original (Image Scale To Total Pixels, ~0.6 MP) to leave headroom inside H3's ~1MP native canvas\n2. **Pad** the scaled image onto a larger canvas (Image Pad For Outpaint). Keep pad amounts as **multiples of 32**\n3. **Condition** H3 on the padded canvas as `first_frame`, with width/height read from the PADDED size — not the original\n4. **Prompt** what should appear in the new area. The preservation suffix is baked into the Nougan Edit Prompt Template\n5. **No resize-back** — the output stays at the extended size\n\n## Tips\n\n- Input + extension must fit the megapixel budget together. See the Size Settings note.\n- Need more extension than one pass allows? Feed the result back in and extend again. Two small passes beat one giant pass.\n- Visible seam at the pad boundary? Switch pad method to `linear ramp`, or re-run a pass over the boundary region.\n- Want more final resolution? Add `RTXVideoSuperResolution` (2×, ULTRA) after Image From Batch.\n- Found a good result? Set Random Noise to `fixed` to lock the seed while you refine the prompt.\n\n— Winnougan"],
      "color": "#432", "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 137, "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [-1600, 4830], "size": [280, 460],
      "flags": {}, "order": 2, "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [], "outputs": [],
      "title": "Note: Size Budget Reference",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": ["| megapixels | Aspect | Output (multiple=32) |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0.2 | 16:9 | 608 x 352 |\n| 0.3 | 16:9 | 736 x 416 |\n| 0.4 | 16:9 | 864 x 480 |\n| 0.5 | 16:9 | 960 x 544 |\n| 0.6 | 16:9 | 1056 x 608 |\n| 0.7 | 16:9 | 1152 x 640 |\n| 0.8 | 16:9 | 1216 x 672 |\n| 0.9 | 16:9 | 1280 x 736 |\n| 0.98 | 16:9 | 1344 x 768 |\n| 1.0 | 16:9 | 1376 x 768 |\n\n## Default padding math\n\n1. Original: 1024 x 1024\n2. Scale to 0.6 MP → 768 x 768\n3. Pad +256 left/right → **1280 x 768** (~0.98 MP ✅)\n4. Generate → extended still at 1280 x 768\n\nKeep all pad values as multiples of 32."],
      "color": "#432", "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
